[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:A Thirsty Ghost]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.47]What evidence is there of a ghost? | 有什么证据说明闹鬼？
[00:15.82]A public house which was recently bought by Mr.Ian Thompson is up for sale. | 伊恩·汤普森先生最近买的一家酒店正在出售。
[00:23.79]Mr.Thompson is going to sell it because it is haunted. | 汤普森先生打算卖掉它，是因为那里闹鬼。
[00:29.63]He told me that he could not go to sleep one night | 他告诉我有天夜里他怎么也睡不着，
[00:33.59]because he heard a strange noise coming from the bar. | 因为他听到酒吧里传来奇怪的响声。
[00:38.90]The next morning, | 第二天早上，
[00:40.43]he found that the doors had been blocked by chairs and the furniture had been moved. | 他发现酒吧的门被椅子堵上了，家具也被挪动过。
[00:47.61]Though Mr.Thompson had turned the lights off before he went to bed, | 虽然汤普森临睡觉时把灯都关掉了，
[00:53.29]they were on in the morning. | 但早晨灯都亮了。
[00:56.42]He also said that he had found five empty whisky bottles | 他还说他发现了5只空的威士忌酒瓶，
[01:01.91]which the ghost must have drunk the night before. | 这肯定是鬼魂头天晚上喝的。
[01:06.68]When I suggested that some villagers must have come | 当我暗示说一定是村里某些人
[01:10.57]in for a free drink, Mr.Thompson shook his head. | 进来喝了免费的酒，汤普森先生摇了摇头。
[01:16.52]The villagers have told him that | 村里的人已经告诉他，
[01:18.79]they will not accept the pub even if he gives it away. | 即使他把酒店白送人，他们也不要。
